flowchart TD
    A[Users report that the application is unavailable]
    B[Confirm the Ubuntu server is reachable]
    C{Is the server reachable?}
    D[Investigate the host or network path]
    E[Test TCP port 80]
    F{Is port 80 listening?}
    G[Check the Nginx service]
    H[Test the Flask backend directly on port 5050]
    I{Is the backend responding?}
    J[Investigate the backend application]
    K[Review the Nginx journal]
    L{Did Nginx crash or stop normally?}
    M[Investigate software or resource failure]
    N[Review SSH sudo and authentication activity]
    O[Compare the command and shutdown times]
    P[Preserve evidence and contain the account]
    Q[Validate the configuration and restart Nginx]
    R[Confirm browser access external connectivity and reboot recovery]

    A --> B --> C
    C -- No --> D
    C -- Yes --> E --> F
    F -- Yes --> J
    F -- No --> G --> H --> I
    I -- No --> J
    I -- Yes --> K --> L
    L -- Crash --> M
    L -- Normal stop --> N --> O --> P --> Q --> R
